T*
(   Properties on JavaScript objects are governed by internal Property Descriptors manipulated via) Tj
T*
(   `Object.defineProperty\(\)`:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Data Descriptor Attributes:) Tj
T*
(   1. value: The actual data value associated with the property \(default: undefined\).) Tj
T*
(   2. writable: Boolean indicating whether the property value can be changed via assignment \(`=`\).) Tj
T*
(   If false, assignments fail silently or throw TypeError in strict mode.) Tj
T*
(   3. enumerable: Boolean determining whether the property shows up during `for...in` loops and) Tj
T*
(   `Object.keys\(\)`. Non-enumerable properties are hidden from normal iteration.) Tj
T*
