(   [Problem Statement]: Explain JavaScript ES6 Classes, constructor methods, static methods, class inheritance \(extends, super\), and private fields \(#\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   ES6 Classes provide syntactic sugar over JavaScript's existing prototype-based inheritance) Tj
T*
(   model:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Syntax & Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   ```javascript) Tj
T*
(   class Employee {) Tj
T*
(   #salary; // Private field \(strictly inaccessible outside class\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
