T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Closures capture outer variables by retaining references to the lexical environment record:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Mechanism of Closure Leaks:) Tj
T*
(   When an inner function references ANY variable in an outer function's scope, modern engines) Tj
T*
(   retain the shared lexical environment object for all functions declared in that scope:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
